{"seq":3,"slug":"semaphores-and-conditions","title":"信号量与条件变量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/threads-concurrency/supplementary/semaphores-and-conditions","wordCount":949,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"信号量与条件变量\">信号量与条件变量</h1><h2 id=\"问题描述\">问题描述</h2><p>在并发编程中，仅靠互斥锁（Mutex）只能实现&quot;互斥访问&quot;——即保证临界区一次只有一个线程执行。但很多场景还需要<strong>线程间的协调与通信</strong>：例如生产者需要通知消费者&quot;有新数据了&quot;，或者限制同时访问某个资源的线程数量。<strong>信号量（Semaphore）</strong> 和 <strong>条件变量（Condition Variable）</strong> 正是为此设计的同步原语。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    SYNC[&quot;Concurrency Synchronization Primitives&quot;] --&gt; MUTEX[&quot;Mutex&lt;br/&gt;Mutex&quot;]&#10;    SYNC --&gt; SEM[&quot;Semaphore&lt;br/&gt;Semaphore&quot;]&#10;    SYNC --&gt; CV[&quot;Condition Variable&lt;br/&gt;Condition Variable&quot;]&#10;    MUTEX --&gt; M1[&quot;Mutual Exclusion&lt;br/&gt;One thread at a time&quot;]&#10;    SEM --&gt; S1[&quot;Control Concurrency Level&lt;br/&gt;Up to N threads&quot;]&#10;    CV --&gt; C1[&quot;Wait and Notify&lt;br/&gt;Inter-thread coordination&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    SYNC[\"Concurrency Synchronization Primitives\"] --&gt; MUTEX[\"Mutex&lt;br/&gt;Mutex\"]\n    SYNC --&gt; SEM[\"Semaphore&lt;br/&gt;Semaphore\"]\n    SYNC --&gt; CV[\"Condition Variable&lt;br/&gt;Condition Variable\"]\n    MUTEX --&gt; M1[\"Mutual Exclusion&lt;br/&gt;One thread at a time\"]\n    SEM --&gt; S1[\"Control Concurrency Level&lt;br/&gt;Up to N threads\"]\n    CV --&gt; C1[\"Wait and Notify&lt;br/&gt;Inter-thread coordination\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"信号量-semaphore\">信号量（Semaphore）</h3><p>信号量是一个维护内部计数器的同步原语，用于控制同时访问某个资源的线程数量。</p>\n<p><strong>基本操作</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">操作</th>\n<th align=\"left\">别名</th>\n<th align=\"left\">说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>wait()</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">P 操作 / acquire / down</td>\n<td align=\"left\">计数器减 1；若计数器 &lt; 0，线程阻塞等待</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>signal()</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">V 操作 / release / up</td>\n<td align=\"left\">计数器加 1；若有线程在等待，唤醒一个</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"信号量 sem(初始值 = N)&#10;&#10;wait(sem):&#10;    sem.count = sem.count - 1&#10;    如果 sem.count &lt; 0:&#10;        将当前线程加入等待队列&#10;        阻塞当前线程&#10;&#10;signal(sem):&#10;    sem.count = sem.count + 1&#10;    如果 等待队列非空:&#10;        唤醒队列中的一个线程\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>信号量 sem(初始值 = N)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>wait(sem):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    sem.count = sem.count - 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    如果 sem.count &#x3C; 0:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        将当前线程加入等待队列</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        阻塞当前线程</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>signal(sem):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    sem.count = sem.count + 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    如果 等待队列非空:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        唤醒队列中的一个线程</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;Semaphore (count = 3)&quot;&#10;        direction TB&#10;        T1[&quot;Thread 1 ✅&quot;] --&gt; RES[&quot;Resource Pool&quot;]&#10;        T2[&quot;Thread 2 ✅&quot;] --&gt; RES&#10;        T3[&quot;Thread 3 ✅&quot;] --&gt; RES&#10;        T4[&quot;Thread 4 ⏳&quot;] -.-&gt;|&quot;Waiting&lt;br/&gt;count = 0&quot;| RES&#10;        T5[&quot;Thread 5 ⏳&quot;] -.-&gt;|&quot;Waiting&quot;| RES&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph \"Semaphore (count = 3)\"\n        direction TB\n        T1[\"Thread 1 ✅\"] --&gt; RES[\"Resource Pool\"]\n        T2[\"Thread 2 ✅\"] --&gt; RES\n        T3[\"Thread 3 ✅\"] --&gt; RES\n        T4[\"Thread 4 ⏳\"] -.-&gt;|\"Waiting&lt;br/&gt;count = 0\"| RES\n        T5[\"Thread 5 ⏳\"] -.-&gt;|\"Waiting\"| RES\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"信号量的类型\">信号量的类型</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">类型</th>\n<th align=\"left\">计数器范围</th>\n<th align=\"left\">用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>计数信号量（Counting Semaphore）</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">0 ~ N</td>\n<td align=\"left\">控制最多 N 个线程同时访问</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>二元信号量（Binary Semaphore）</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">0 或 1</td>\n<td align=\"left\">功能类似互斥锁</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"二元信号量-vs-互斥锁\">二元信号量 vs 互斥锁</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">对比维度</th>\n<th align=\"left\">二元信号量</th>\n<th align=\"left\">互斥锁</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>所有权</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">无所有权概念，任何线程可 signal</td>\n<td align=\"left\">只有持有者可以释放</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>用途</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">主要用于信号通知</td>\n<td align=\"left\">主要用于保护临界区</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>递归</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">不支持递归获取</td>\n<td align=\"left\">部分实现支持递归锁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>优先级反转</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">通常不处理</td>\n<td align=\"left\">可通过优先级继承解决</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"典型场景\">典型场景</h2><h3 id=\"条件变量-condition-variable\">条件变量（Condition Variable）</h3><p>条件变量是一种允许线程在某个条件不满足时挂起等待，并在条件满足时被其他线程唤醒的同步机制。它<strong>必须与互斥锁配合使用</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>基本操作</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">操作</th>\n<th align=\"left\">说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>wait(cond, mutex)</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">释放互斥锁，挂起等待；被唤醒后重新获取锁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>signal(cond)</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">唤醒一个等待中的线程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>broadcast(cond)</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">唤醒所有等待中的线程</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"条件变量 cond&#10;互斥锁 mutex&#10;&#10;// 等待方（消费者）&#10;获取锁(mutex)&#10;当 条件不满足 时:       // 必须用循环，防止虚假唤醒&#10;    wait(cond, mutex)    // 原子地释放锁并挂起&#10;// 被唤醒后，锁已重新获取&#10;执行操作()&#10;释放锁(mutex)&#10;&#10;// 通知方（生产者）&#10;获取锁(mutex)&#10;修改共享状态使条件满足&#10;signal(cond)             // 或 broadcast(cond)&#10;释放锁(mutex)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>条件变量 cond</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>互斥锁 mutex</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 等待方（消费者）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>获取锁(mutex)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>当 条件不满足 时:       // 必须用循环，防止虚假唤醒</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    wait(cond, mutex)    // 原子地释放锁并挂起</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 被唤醒后，锁已重新获取</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>执行操作()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>释放锁(mutex)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 通知方（生产者）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>获取锁(mutex)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>修改共享状态使条件满足</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>signal(cond)             // 或 broadcast(cond)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>释放锁(mutex)</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant P as Producer&#10;    participant M as Mutex + Condition Variable&#10;    participant C as Consumer&#10;&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;M: Acquire lock&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;M: Check: Is queue empty?&#10;    Note over C: Condition not met&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;M: wait() - Release lock and suspend&#10;&#10;    P-&gt;&gt;M: Acquire lock&#10;    P-&gt;&gt;M: Add data to queue&#10;    P-&gt;&gt;M: signal() - Wake up consumer&#10;    P-&gt;&gt;M: Release lock&#10;&#10;    M-&gt;&gt;C: Woken up, reacquire lock&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;M: Check: Queue is not empty ✅&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;C: Retrieve data and process&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;M: Release lock\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant P as Producer\n    participant M as Mutex + Condition Variable\n    participant C as Consumer\n\n    C-&gt;&gt;M: Acquire lock\n    C-&gt;&gt;M: Check: Is queue empty?\n    Note over C: Condition not met\n    C-&gt;&gt;M: wait() - Release lock and suspend\n\n    P-&gt;&gt;M: Acquire lock\n    P-&gt;&gt;M: Add data to queue\n    P-&gt;&gt;M: signal() - Wake up consumer\n    P-&gt;&gt;M: Release lock\n\n    M-&gt;&gt;C: Woken up, reacquire lock\n    C-&gt;&gt;M: Check: Queue is not empty ✅\n    C-&gt;&gt;C: Retrieve data and process\n    C-&gt;&gt;M: Release lock</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>虚假唤醒（Spurious Wakeup）</strong>：系统可能在没有 signal 的情况下唤醒等待线程。因此等待条件必须放在循环中，而非简单的 if 判断。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"解决方案\">解决方案</h2><h3 id=\"生产者-消费者模式\">生产者-消费者模式</h3><p>这是信号量和条件变量最经典的应用场景。生产者生产数据放入缓冲区，消费者从缓冲区取出数据。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    P1[&quot;🏭 Producer 1&quot;] --&gt; BUF[&quot;📦 Bounded Buffer&lt;br/&gt;Capacity = N&quot;]&#10;    P2[&quot;🏭 Producer 2&quot;] --&gt; BUF&#10;    BUF --&gt; C1[&quot;🛒 Consumer 1&quot;]&#10;    BUF --&gt; C2[&quot;🛒 Consumer 2&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    P1[\"🏭 Producer 1\"] --&gt; BUF[\"📦 Bounded Buffer&lt;br/&gt;Capacity = N\"]\n    P2[\"🏭 Producer 2\"] --&gt; BUF\n    BUF --&gt; C1[\"🛒 Consumer 1\"]\n    BUF --&gt; C2[\"🛒 Consumer 2\"]</pre><h4 id=\"使用信号量实现\">使用信号量实现</h4><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"信号量 empty = N        // 缓冲区空位数量&#10;信号量 full = 0         // 缓冲区已有数据数量&#10;互斥锁 mutex            // 保护缓冲区的互斥访问&#10;&#10;生产者:&#10;    循环:&#10;        item = 生产数据()&#10;        wait(empty)          // 等待有空位&#10;        获取锁(mutex)&#10;            缓冲区.放入(item)&#10;        释放锁(mutex)&#10;        signal(full)         // 通知消费者有新数据&#10;&#10;消费者:&#10;    循环:&#10;        wait(full)           // 等待有数据&#10;        获取锁(mutex)&#10;            item = 缓冲区.取出()&#10;        释放锁(mutex)&#10;        signal(empty)        // 通知生产者有空位&#10;        消费数据(item)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>信号量 empty = N        // 缓冲区空位数量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>信号量 full = 0         // 缓冲区已有数据数量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>互斥锁 mutex            // 保护缓冲区的互斥访问</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>生产者:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    循环:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        item = 生产数据()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        wait(empty)          // 等待有空位</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        获取锁(mutex)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            缓冲区.放入(item)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        释放锁(mutex)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        signal(full)         // 通知消费者有新数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>消费者:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    循环:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        wait(full)           // 等待有数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        获取锁(mutex)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            item = 缓冲区.取出()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        释放锁(mutex)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        signal(empty)        // 通知生产者有空位</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        消费数据(item)</span></span></code></pre></div><h4 id=\"使用条件变量实现\">使用条件变量实现</h4><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"互斥锁 mutex&#10;条件变量 not_full&#10;条件变量 not_empty&#10;队列 buffer（容量 N）&#10;&#10;生产者:&#10;    循环:&#10;        item = 生产数据()&#10;        获取锁(mutex)&#10;        当 buffer.size == N 时:&#10;            wait(not_full, mutex)    // 缓冲区满，等待&#10;        buffer.放入(item)&#10;        signal(not_empty)            // 唤醒等待的消费者&#10;        释放锁(mutex)&#10;&#10;消费者:&#10;    循环:&#10;        获取锁(mutex)&#10;        当 buffer.size == 0 时:&#10;            wait(not_empty, mutex)   // 缓冲区空，等待&#10;        item = buffer.取出()&#10;        signal(not_full)             // 唤醒等待的生产者&#10;        释放锁(mutex)&#10;        消费数据(item)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>互斥锁 mutex</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>条件变量 not_full</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>条件变量 not_empty</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>队列 buffer（容量 N）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>生产者:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    循环:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        item = 生产数据()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        获取锁(mutex)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        当 buffer.size == N 时:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            wait(not_full, mutex)    // 缓冲区满，等待</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        buffer.放入(item)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        signal(not_empty)            // 唤醒等待的消费者</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        释放锁(mutex)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>消费者:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    循环:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        获取锁(mutex)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        当 buffer.size == 0 时:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            wait(not_empty, mutex)   // 缓冲区空，等待</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        item = buffer.取出()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        signal(not_full)             // 唤醒等待的生产者</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        释放锁(mutex)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        消费数据(item)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"信号量-vs-条件变量对比\">信号量 vs 条件变量对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">对比维度</th>\n<th align=\"left\">信号量</th>\n<th align=\"left\">条件变量</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>内部状态</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">维护计数器</td>\n<td align=\"left\">无内部状态（依赖外部条件）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>配合锁使用</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">不需要额外的锁</td>\n<td align=\"left\">必须与互斥锁配合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>等待条件</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">隐含在计数器中</td>\n<td align=\"left\">由程序员显式定义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>唤醒语义</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">signal 有累积效果（计数器 +1）</td>\n<td align=\"left\">signal 无累积效果（无等待者则丢失）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>灵活性</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">适合简单的计数场景</td>\n<td align=\"left\">适合复杂的条件判断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>虚假唤醒</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">无此问题</td>\n<td align=\"left\">需要循环检查条件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"typescript-风格的信号量抽象\">TypeScript 风格的信号量抽象</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface Semaphore {&#10;  readonly count: number;&#10;  acquire(): Promise&lt;void&gt;;&#10;  release(): void;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function createSemaphore(maxCount: number): Semaphore {&#10;  let count = maxCount;&#10;  const waitQueue: Array&lt;() =&gt; void&gt; = [];&#10;&#10;  return {&#10;    get count() {&#10;      return count;&#10;    },&#10;    acquire() {&#10;      return new Promise&lt;void&gt;((resolve) =&gt; {&#10;        if (count &gt; 0) {&#10;          count--;&#10;          resolve();&#10;        } else {&#10;          waitQueue.push(resolve);&#10;        }&#10;      });&#10;    },&#10;    release() {&#10;      const next = waitQueue.shift();&#10;      if (next) {&#10;        next();&#10;      } else {&#10;        count++;&#10;      }&#10;    },&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Semaphore</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  acquire</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  release</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createSemaphore</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">maxCount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Semaphore</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> maxCount;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> waitQueue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    get</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    acquire</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">resolve</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">--</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">          resolve</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          waitQueue.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(resolve);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    release</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> next</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> waitQueue.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">shift</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (next) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        next</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>信号量与条件变量是并发编程中两种重要的同步原语：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>信号量</strong>通过内部计数器控制并发访问数量，分为计数信号量（限制 N 个并发）和二元信号量（类似互斥锁）</li>\n<li><strong>条件变量</strong>允许线程在条件不满足时挂起等待，条件满足时被唤醒，必须与互斥锁配合使用</li>\n<li>等待条件必须放在<strong>循环</strong>中以防止虚假唤醒</li>\n<li><strong>生产者-消费者</strong>是两者最经典的应用场景，信号量用计数器隐式表达条件，条件变量用显式条件判断</li>\n<li>信号量适合简单的并发数量控制，条件变量适合复杂的条件等待与通知</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"信号量与条件变量","id":"信号量与条件变量"},{"level":2,"text":"问题描述","id":"问题描述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"信号量（Semaphore）","id":"信号量-semaphore"},{"level":3,"text":"信号量的类型","id":"信号量的类型"},{"level":3,"text":"二元信号量 vs 互斥锁","id":"二元信号量-vs-互斥锁"},{"level":2,"text":"典型场景","id":"典型场景"},{"level":3,"text":"条件变量（Condition Variable）","id":"条件变量-condition-variable"},{"level":2,"text":"解决方案","id":"解决方案"},{"level":3,"text":"生产者-消费者模式","id":"生产者-消费者模式"},{"level":4,"text":"使用信号量实现","id":"使用信号量实现"},{"level":4,"text":"使用条件变量实现","id":"使用条件变量实现"},{"level":3,"text":"信号量 vs 条件变量对比","id":"信号量-vs-条件变量对比"},{"level":3,"text":"TypeScript 风格的信号量抽象","id":"typescript-风格的信号量抽象"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"死锁、活锁与饥饿","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/threads-concurrency/supplementary/deadlock-livelock-starvation"},"next":{"title":"线程池与任务调度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/threads-concurrency/supplementary/thread-pools"}}